language ESSENCE' 1.0
$ Find three integers between 1 and 10 such that every given number is the sum of a subset of the three.
given numbers_dim1 : int(1..)
given numbers : matrix indexed by [int(1..numbers_dim1)] of int(1..10)
find x : matrix indexed by [int(1..3)] of int(1..10)

branching on [x]

such that
$ each given number equals the sum of some subset of x (the subset is chosen by three booleans, at least one of them true)
forAll i : int(1..numbers_dim1) . (exists a, b, c : bool . (((a \/ b \/ c)) /\ ((toInt(a) * x[1] + toInt(b) * x[2] + toInt(c) * x[3]) = numbers[i])))
